This repository contains analysis scripts and figure code written only for
the systematic review:

  Postharvest agricultural waste-derived biochar for immobilization of
  potentially toxic elements in contaminated agricultural soils:
  Implications for leafy vegetable safety and human health. A systematic
  review.

The code is bound to the local files and coding rules in this repository
(including ANALYSIS SET.csv and the extraction structure used to build it).
It is not a general-purpose toolkit and is not intended for other studies.

Permission is not granted to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute,
sublicense, run, or adapt any part of this code for another study or for
any other purpose.

No license, express or implied, is conferred by access to this repository.

